# Business Case Churn Analysis

## Project Overview

This project explores customer churn trends and behavioral risk indicators using exploratory data analysis and visualization techniques.

The objective was to identify customer patterns associated with churn risk and provide business-focused retention recommendations.

---

## Tools Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook
- VS Code

---

## Analysis Focus Areas

The project focused on analyzing:

- Customer contract behavior
- Monthly churn trends
- Customer tenure
- Retention risk patterns

---

## Key Insights

### Contract Type Strongly Influenced Churn

Customers on month-to-month contracts demonstrated substantially higher churn behavior than customers with long-term contracts.

---

### Monthly Trends Revealed Churn Patterns

Monthly customer activity showed fluctuations associated with elevated churn risk periods.

---

### Customer Tenure Impacted Retention

Customers with shorter tenure periods demonstrated higher churn probability compared to long-term customers.

